    {
      "id": "sec_s1l17_r3",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Upar zikr kiye gaye tamaam Quranic alfaaz ke aakhir mein (ة/ـة) hai. Aise tamaam alfaaz Arabic mein muannath hote hain aur mein alfaaz ke liye ism-e-ishaarah (هٰذِهِ) aayega. Kuch aise alfaaz bhi hain jin ke aakhir mein (ة/ـة) nahi hai lekin Arabic mein unhein muannath maana jaata hai jaise (جَهَنَّمُ), (نَارٌ), (سَمَاءٌ), (أَرْضٌ). Ab aap darj zail jumlon ko khud samajh kar tarjuma kijiye:",
